  "description": "Ultra-high-performance HTTP/1.1 and HTTP/2 web framework for .NET 8+. Built from scratch for maximum speed with zero-allocation routing, custom HTTP/2 implementation with HPACK compression, and sub-50μs response times. 6-10x faster than ASP.NET Core for API workloads.",
